WEBVTT

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:27.770
Are you all right?

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.790
Just barely.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.000
You big pervert!

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.880
Target 1520, destruction confirmed.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:44.510
Progressive signature indeterminable.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.440
Defense level green.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:48.940
SARG 5.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.110
Mission 1520 is a success.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.810
You're hereby relieved of duty.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:55.910
Roger.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.690
Attention.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:01.250
Maintenance crew, SARGs 1, 3,
and 4 will be docked at 1900.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:02.320
Repeat.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:06.450
SARGs 1, 3, and 4 to be docked at 1900.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.060
Frank...

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.910
That day, you...

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.330
That day... what...

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.190
You were helping me, right?

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.860
Frank is really kind.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:28.450
He comes to save me
no matter the time or place.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.890
Harriet...

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.630
What are you?

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.520
Where do you come from?
Where are you going?

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:43.510
Ask him.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.590
Ask him!

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:48.830
Please.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.610
Where did you come from?

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.850
From beyond the sky?

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:07.620
Don't you remember?

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.730
Beautiful...

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.200
Very...

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.540
...beautiful.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.240
Beautiful?

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.760
Where did you come from?

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:30.810
Very...

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.280
Where are you going?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.180
Ask him!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.350
Where is he going?

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:42.090
Frank, are you going somewhere?

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.650
You're not, are you?

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.970
After all, this is our home, right?

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.700
Beautiful...

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:07.370
Very beautiful...

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.660
At least you're in one piece.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.170
Good thing we didn't need the cavalry.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.090
Would've made us look bad.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.810
But I still don't get what
that alien was trying to do.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:44.750
You should have asked it.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.460
It may have answered you.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:51.020
Yeah, like Frank.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.960
Then I'll give it a try.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:54.520
Next time, of course.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:06:59.570
Guenevere, what's wrong?

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:03.360
Emergency!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.670
Emergency!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.700
Code 308!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.120
What's wrong with SARG 3?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.480
Communications are fine,
but something's wrong.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:17.750
Initiating fail-safe program.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:19.630
Hardware nominal.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.150
Software error confirmed.

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:24.720
Processing interruption detected.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.520
Lt. Green, what about the manual override?

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.350
No good. I can't get it to work!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:34.260
I don't think the mechanics would cut corners.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:35.670
Of course not.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:36.830
Lt. Simmons.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:37.820
Lt. Harris.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.610
Engage SARG 3.

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:40.530
We're on it!
Engage SARG 3.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.920
How's the inertial eliminator?

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.170
It's on, but I don't know for how long.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.390
Where the heck is she going?

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.100
"Where is she going?"

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.940
The Pilgrimage Point?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.480
Assuming current speed...

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:22.820
...estimated time of arrival is 50 minutes.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.210
Commander!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:38.920
SARG 3's alien motor was
somehow affected by that alien?

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:40.430
Could it be...

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.700
Revenge?

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:46.390
The aliens are getting even for
what we've done to them!

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:47.560
Revenge?

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.870
Lt. Green, get out of there at once.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:56.010
SARG 3 will be handled with nuclear weapons.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:09.060
SARGs 1 and 4, get Lt. Green
out and evacuate to safe ground.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.530
Why?

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:15.080
SARG 3 going to the Pilgrimage
Point means nuclear bombs?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.790
That's what the bureau wants.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.300
Get to it!

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:19.530
Roger.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.240
I can't bail out!

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.390
What?

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:30.580
It's the alien's...

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.950
Stop kidding!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.400
Guenevere!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.990
The FCS is working itself!

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:48.890
Dan!

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.690
SARGs 1 and 4 lost. SARG 3 accelerating.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.770
10 minutes to the red zone.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.910
Commander!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.140
I know...

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:39.650
General, it's me.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.920
Sorry, I can't rescind that order.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:43.720
But...

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:47.930
You don't want to lose Funeral either, do you?

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:00.330
SARG 3 has entered the red zone.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:05.950
Lt. Soma.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:07.470
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.340
Frank should go, too.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.930
He's an important source of data.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.230
But...

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:29.680
Have you forgotten?

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:34.770
If Frank were to enter the dark zone,
he will be subjected to attacks.

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:13.240
I can't die... I don't want to die.

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.840
Not yet at least.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.950
Free to move about the heavens?

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:22.010
Yes.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.570
Better make sure you're ready.

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:36.080
When Commander Ines takes
you in, you're in all the way.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.350
Mister...

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.320
This is Fox Leader.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.090
Disengage safeties.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.030
Lock on to target.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.970
Prepare for evacuation
sequence once missiles deploy.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.490
Lt. Soma!

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.200
Lieutenant, are you all right?

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.400
Y-Yes...

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:08.180
Gravitational distortion
from the alien motor?

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:25.410
It wasn't an alien motor
in the SARG's fuselage...

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.500
It was an actual dead alien!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.370
Have we been...

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:54.980
...riding around on dead aliens?

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:56.640
Could it be?

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:59.770
Is the limiter for controlling that power?

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:04.710
Were the SARGs flying coffins?

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.130
Commander, were you aware of this?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.930
You have to fight fire with fire.

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.440
I couldn't object to their methods.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.480
Until today.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:41.010
Are you the angel of death?

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:51.100
If I'm off just a little, the lieutenant is...

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:53.690
SARG 5, you need to change course.

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:57.900
What are you doing? Get out of the way!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.030
Didn't you hear?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:01.540
Do as you're ordered!

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.040
But...

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.200
I don't need company on this trip.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.720
My future's already been negated.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.680
Negated?

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:11.740
Right.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.490
A long time ago.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:26.530
I saw the haunting glow of death
during the accident on the station.

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:30.760
My life was negated before my eyes.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:48.160
I prepared myself for my ultimate destiny.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.250
And now it's time to check in...

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:53.600
You can cancel that reservation!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.530
Ryu!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:04.260
I'm not watching people I know
die before my eyes anymore!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.010
Ryu...

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:30.600
Lieutenant!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.770
Attacking so precisely...

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:37.560
Like how I fight...

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:46.340
Stop!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:49.910
Ryu!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.450
Distance 130 to dark zone.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.060
SARG 5, withdraw at once!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:11.560
SARG 5!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:14.640
Can't you just stop being so convinced...

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.230
...that your destiny is so tightly carved in stone?

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.610
People can rewrite their destinies!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.410
Over and over again!

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:29.750
Until it gets disgusting!

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:31.120
Damn it!

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:50.440
Stop!

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:37.350
I can't escape from destiny.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:01.300
More... I wanted to fly more...

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:04.350
Freely about the heavens...

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:05.910
Like a bird...

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:10.390
SARG 3 is 25 to dark zone.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.300
Lovely...

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:21.440
Very...

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:39.420
Frank...

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.840
Harriet?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.190
Frank!

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:18.230
Target neutralized. Abort mission.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.280
Pull out.

00:21:56.030 --> 00:21:57.120
Ryu...

00:21:57.200 --> 00:21:58.590
Harriet...

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:01.760
Thanks to you, I can fly a while longer.

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:04.720
Not yet...

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:09.180
You can't die just yet.

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:40.010
The prisoner is restrained,
shackled in heavy irons.

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:43.110
Bound to the evidence that cries a warning.

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:45.400
Within the ring of the contract.

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:49.100
Next time,
Crimes and Punishments.
